{"unit_id":"Jackson-chen97__dsh-devops#card-zh","repo":"Jackson-chen97/dsh-devops","commit":"b135f0ff34608122e9e3c27c54a75c6094aa9fca","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-devops**（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在 DSH 中集中管理 GitLab 项目与 Kubernetes 集群。它注册 GitLab 和 Kubernetes AI 工具，并提供侧边栏控制台、会话标签页和设置页面。可查看与操作合并请求、流水线、部署、Pod、事件和日志，也能配置 webhook 通知及后台告警监控。适合需要从 DSH 对话或网页界面处理 CI/CD 与集群运维的开发者。需要配置 GitLab 访问令牌；使用 Kubernetes 功能时还需提供 kubeconfig。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/plugin.ts:38-70","src/client/index.ts:32-77","src/config.ts:28-54"]}
{"unit_id":"Jackson-chen97__dsh-devops#card-en","repo":"Jackson-chen97/dsh-devops","commit":"b135f0ff34608122e9e3c27c54a75c6094aa9fca","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-devops** (DSH plugin, Web client): Manage GitLab projects and Kubernetes clusters from DSH. It registers GitLab and Kubernetes AI tools and provides a sidebar console, conversation tab, and settings page. Users can inspect and operate on merge requests, pipelines, deployments, pods, events, and logs, with optional webhook notifications and background alerts. It suits developers handling CI/CD and cluster operations through DSH chat or its web interface. GitLab access requires a personal token; Kubernetes features require a kubeconfig.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host/plugin.ts:38-70","src/client/index.ts:32-77","src/config.ts:28-54"]}
